# 行尾统一：索引一律 LF。仓建于 2026-09-16，工作区里 Windows 编辑器留下的 CRLF
# 在入库时归一化，避免以后出现整文件重写的假 diff。
* text=auto eol=lf

# cmd.exe 解释的脚本必须 CRLF（标签跳转在 LF 下会出错）
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

# 二进制资产
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.xls binary
*.xlsx binary
*.rvm binary
*.e3d binary
*.pen binary
*.zip binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
